  <p class="lead-sub">For each assignment: can a student under 18 complete it as written, where is the student stopped, and what does the student do instead?</p>
  <div class="note"><p><strong>Early stage, in development.</strong> Testing ran from 3 to 4 October 2026. Both accounts were run on all 27 example assignments: 14 AI courses, 11 high-risk content courses, and 2 courses added for Deep Research and music generation. The assignments are examples built for demonstration. The results come from one run per step.</p></div>
  <div class="stats">
   <div class="stat"><div class="n">27</div><div class="l">Assignments run in both accounts</div></div>
   <div class="stat"><div class="n">18</div><div class="l">Completed as written</div></div>
   <div class="stat"><div class="n">8</div><div class="l">Completed with an alternate step</div></div>
   <div class="stat"><div class="n">1</div><div class="l">Not completable in Gemini</div></div>
  </div>
